{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_24","type":"agent_message","text":"The measurements show a safe hybrid path: custom fused preprocessing is best for small/medium workloads, compiled preprocessing wins for large tensors, and batched K/V weight gradients save a launch while remaining bit-identical up through the relevant reduction sizes. I’m validating one final option—compiling the whole GEMM graph—before spending the second official verification run."}}
